  order: ASC
  page: 1
}

docs {
  KMLTTB (Kenya Medical Laboratory Technicians and Technologists Board) —
  the body that licenses diagnostic labs, not PPB — runs a separate public
  facilities register at a different host (`kmlttb.org`, not
  `practice.pharmacyboardkenya.org`).

  Change `search` to try another laboratory name.

  Working sample: `Cerba Lancet` returns multiple branches (e.g. "CERBA
  LANCET KENYA LIMITED BURUBURU", "CERBA LANCET KENYA LIMITED ELDORET") —
  KMLTTB licenses per-branch, same as PPB does for retail/wholesale.

  Each result row links to a detail page via `view_record.php?id=<id>`.
  Unlike PPB, KMLTTB's detail page shows the **full, unmasked** Licence No
  (e.g. `L 03871/25`), alongside a separate File No, Class, County, and
  "Valid Until" date — so verification against it can be an exact match
  rather than PPB's masked prefix/suffix comparison.
}
